://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/219298974","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1529#issuecomment-219298974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1529","id":219298974,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIxOTI5ODk3NA==","user":{"login":"javier-tarazaga","id":7814134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTQxMzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7814134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga","html_url":"https://github.com/javier-tarazaga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-05-15T17:30:04Z","updated_at":"2016-05-15T17:30:04Z","body":"Really!!? Never thought a MP4 with PIFF brand would play using TYPE_SS.\n\nDon't have a device today with me but will check tomorrow first thing in the morning! Also will give it a try with encrypted content to check if everything works correctly as well. \n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/219298974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"javier-tarazaga","id":7814134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTQxMzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7814134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga","html_url":"https://github.com/javier-tarazaga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javier-tarazaga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/219322776","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1529#issuecomment-219322776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1529","id":219322776,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIxOTMyMjc3Ng==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-05-15T23:57:15Z","updated_at":"2016-05-15T23:58:16Z","body":"Ah, when using `TYPE_SS` ExoPlayer actually ends up fetching the SmoothStreaming manifest at:\n\n```\nhttp://vod-mp4.sfanytime.com/trailers/17000/17347/17347_download_eng_LOW_920.ism/Manifest\n```\n\nwhich it then plays correctly. It's unclear why you're trying to play the fragmented mp4 directly? Given it lacks a segment index, it's not (efficiently) seekable. The SmoothStreaming manifest provides seeking information, so it's better to play it that way.\n\nExoPlayer doesn't play the fragmented mp4 directly for a couple of reasons:\n1. We don't parse the `mehd` box, which leads to ExoPlayer determining an incorrect duration for the stream. We can fix this.\n2. There aren't any `tfdt` boxes in the stream. Which I believe is normal for `piff`, but isn't something we handle currently. We can probably do so.\n\nEven if we fix the above, we still wont allow seeking in this type of media. So you should really play the SmoothStreaming manifest, rather than the video file directly.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/219322776/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/o